{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"LAM","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"耶利米哀歌","commonName":"耶利米哀歌","title":"耶利米哀歌","order":25,"numberOfChapters":5,"sha256":"ceb31f364800e6afe6cf9c657c027835180bb4ba8d0a4cc896c6832df155fb00","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/LAM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":5,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/LAM/5.json","totalNumberOfVerses":154},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華刑罰耶路撒冷"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"主何竟發怒，使黑雲遮蔽錫安城！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他將以色列的華美從天扔在地上；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在他發怒的日子並不記念自己的腳凳。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"主吞滅雅各一切的住處，並不顧惜。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他發怒傾覆猶大民的保障，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使這保障坍倒在地；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他辱沒這國和其中的首領。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"他發烈怒，把以色列的角全然砍斷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在仇敵面前收回右手。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他像火焰四圍吞滅，將雅各燒毀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"他張弓好像仇敵；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他站着舉起右手，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同敵人將悅人眼目的，盡行殺戮。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在錫安百姓的帳棚上","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"倒出他的忿怒，像火一樣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"主如仇敵吞滅以色列和錫安的一切宮殿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拆毀百姓的保障；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在猶大民中加增悲傷哭號。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"他強取自己的帳幕，好像是園中的窩棚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毀壞他的聚會之處。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華使聖節和安息日在錫安都被忘記，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又在怒氣的憤恨中藐視君王和祭司。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"耶和華丟棄自己的祭壇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"憎惡自己的聖所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將宮殿的牆垣交付仇敵。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們在耶和華的殿中喧嚷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像在聖會之日一樣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"耶和華定意拆毀錫安的城牆；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他拉了準繩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不將手收回，定要毀滅。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他使外郭和城牆都悲哀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一同衰敗。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"錫安的門都陷入地內；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主將她的門閂毀壞，折斷。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的君王和首領落在沒有律法的列國中；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的先知不得見耶和華的異象。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"錫安城的長老坐在地上默默無聲；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們揚起塵土落在頭上，腰束麻布；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷的處女垂頭至地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"我眼中流淚，以致失明；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的心腸擾亂，肝膽塗地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都因我眾民遭毀滅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又因孩童和吃奶的在城內街上發昏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"那時，他們在城內街上發昏，好像受傷的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在母親的懷裏，將要喪命；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"對母親說：穀、酒在哪裏呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"耶路撒冷的民哪，我可用甚麼向你證明呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我可用甚麼與你相比呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"錫安的民哪，我可拿甚麼和你比較，好安慰你呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你的裂口大如海，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰能醫治你呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"你的先知為你見虛假和愚昧的異象，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並沒有顯露你的罪孽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你被擄的歸回；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻為你見虛假的默示","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和使你被趕出本境的緣故。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"凡過路的都向你拍掌。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們向耶路撒冷城嗤笑，搖頭，說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道人所稱為全美的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"稱為全地所喜悅的，就是這城嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"你的仇敵都向你大大張口；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們嗤笑，又切齒說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們吞滅她。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這真是我們所盼望的日子臨到了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們親眼看見了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"耶和華成就了他所定的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"應驗了他古時所命定的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他傾覆了，並不顧惜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你的仇敵向你誇耀；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你敵人的角也被高舉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"錫安民的心哀求主。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"錫安的城牆啊，願你流淚如河，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"晝夜不息；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願你眼中的瞳人淚流不止。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"夜間，每逢交更的時候要起來呼喊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在主面前傾心如水。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的孩童在各市口上受餓發昏；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要為他們的性命向主舉手禱告。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，求你觀看！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"見你向誰這樣行？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"婦人豈可吃自己所生育手裏所搖弄的嬰孩嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祭司和先知豈可在主的聖所中被殺戮嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"少年人和老年人都在街上躺臥；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的處女和壯丁都倒在刀下；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你發怒的日子殺死他們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你殺了，並不顧惜。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"你招聚四圍驚嚇我的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像在大會的日子招聚人一樣。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華發怒的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人逃脫，無人存留。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我所搖弄所養育的嬰孩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仇敵都殺淨了。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/LAM/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/LAM/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/LAM/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}